        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to these services, we also offer managed services, including hosted private branch exchange, managed WiFi, premiere technical support and network solutions, security and network access and equipment for SMB customers.",
