        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our footprint outside of the New York metropolitan area, for enterprise and larger commercial customers, we offer high capacity data services, including wide area networking and dedicated data access and advanced services such as wireless mesh networks.",
